  "title": "Biscotti",
  "description": "Biscotti are twice-baked Italian cookies that are wonderfully light, crisp, and perfect for dipping in coffee. Drizzle with chocolate for a delicious festive gift.",
  "authors": [
    "JANDEE"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-04-02T15:39:33-04:00",
